WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.684 --> 00:00:07.966
Hey, flag!

2
00:00:08.206 --> 00:00:09.326
Tell us about yourself!

3
00:00:10.387 --> 00:00:13.908
"I am the Hinomaru, which means "sun disc."

4
00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:21.030
The sun disc, which is actually my red circle, has been the symbol of Japan for centuries.

5
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.811
Many Japanese flags have used the sun disc.

6
00:00:25.911 --> 00:00:29.232
You may have seen a different flag in a war movie.

7
00:00:29.788 --> 00:00:31.909
It is called the Rising Sun.

8
00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.611
The Japanese navy used it during World War II.

9
00:00:36.292 --> 00:00:42.175
Some people think that it was the Japanese national flag during the war, but they are mistaken.

10
00:00:42.815 --> 00:00:45.937
The Rising Sun was only a military flag.

11
00:00:46.637 --> 00:00:49.619
I have been the Japanese flag for a long time.

12
00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:55.302
In the year 1274, the Mongols attacked Japan.

13
00:00:56.082 --> 00:01:03.676
Nichiren, a Japanese Buddhist priest, presented a sun flag to a very powerful Japanese warrior.

14
00:01:04.336 --> 00:01:09.080
He believed that with this symbol, the Japanese could defeat the Mongols.

15
00:01:10.101 --> 00:01:14.804
Ever since then, the sun disc has been an important symbol for the Japanese."

16
00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:18.287
Hey, flag!

17
00:01:18.547 --> 00:01:19.708
Tell us about yourself.

18
00:01:19.728 --> 00:01:23.411
"I am the flag of the People's Republic of China.

19
00:01:24.212 --> 00:01:28.936
I have been used since 1920, but I looked a little different back then.

20
00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.622
I got my new look in 1949.

21
00:01:34.163 --> 00:01:39.687
Red is the color of the Communist Revolution, which happened almost one hundred years ago.

22
00:01:40.448 --> 00:01:45.211
During the revolution, many people died to make China a communist country.

23
00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:51.396
In a communist country, the goal is for all the people to be treated equally and for them

24
00:01:51.476 --> 00:01:52.977
to share all the wealth.

25
00:01:54.038 --> 00:01:57.100
So the Chinese people are proud of my red color.

26
00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.582
I have five yellow stars.

27
00:02:00.262 --> 00:02:03.605
The large star represents the Communist Party of China.

28
00:02:04.226 --> 00:02:07.288
The Communist Party leads all the Chinese people.

29
00:02:08.489 --> 00:02:11.592
The four small stars represent the Chinese people.

30
00:02:12.473 --> 00:02:19.559
Some people say that the small stars represent the workers, farmers, scholars, and business owners.

31
00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:25.124
The five stars show that all the people are united under the Communist Party."

32
00:02:27.828 --> 00:02:28.569
Hey, flag!

33
00:02:28.829 --> 00:02:29.970
Tell us about yourself.

34
00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:33.192
"I am the flag of the Republic of Korea.

35
00:02:33.672 --> 00:02:35.754
You can call me the Taegeukgi.

36
00:02:36.554 --> 00:02:42.378
I have looked like this since 1950, but other flags similar to me have been used by Korean

37
00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:44.279
kings for hundreds of years.

38
00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:50.063
Many hundreds of years ago, my colors were very different.

39
00:02:50.204 --> 00:02:53.786
In 1882, I looked almost the same as I do now.

40
00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.208
Can you see the differences?

41
00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.402
My design and colors have changed, but my meaning remains the same.

42
00:03:03.142 --> 00:03:06.264
It comes from a very old oriental philosophy.

43
00:03:06.944 --> 00:03:13.226
The circle in the center is a symbol of eum-yang, which the Chinese people call yin-yang.

44
00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:19.029
The blue part represents eum, which is negative, dark, and cold.

45
00:03:19.729 --> 00:03:24.531
The red part represents yang, which is positive, bright, and hot.

46
00:03:25.272 --> 00:03:28.950
Together, they symbolize balance and harmony.

47
00:03:29.771 --> 00:03:37.038
The bar on my top-left side means the sky; the one on the top-right means water; the bottom-left

48
00:03:37.218 --> 00:03:41.161
one means fire; and the bottom-right one means the earth.

49
00:03:42.663 --> 00:03:48.648
Most importantly, I am not a flag of war, but one that stands for peace and harmony.

50
00:03:49.509 --> 00:03:52.892
Even my white background represents peace and purity.

51
00:03:55.848 --> 00:04:00.632
If you want to know about the history of a country, start by learning about its flag.

52
00:04:01.173 --> 00:04:04.075
A flag can speak a thousand words."
